%% Failure recovery
flowchart TD
    F{Failure type}
    F -- Product unavailable --> R1[Search replacement / substitution]
    F -- Price changed --> R2[Recompute budget on real total]
    F -- Cart expired --> R3[Rebuild cart idempotently]
    F -- Browser crashed --> R4[Restore session if safe else fail]
    F -- Payment timeout --> R5[Check status BEFORE retry]
    F -- Duplicate risk --> R6[Reconcile via idempotency store]
    F -- Scraper failure --> R7[Fallback source / partial result]
    F -- LLM timeout/malformed --> R8[Deterministic fallback]
    R5 --> SAFE[[Never blind-retry financial ops]]
    R6 --> SAFE
